{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "latam", "appid": 924970, "month": "2025-04", "window": 1, "start_date": 1743465600, "end_date": 1746057599, "month_true_total": 9, "quota": 9, "returned": 9, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:56:48 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "193855232", "author": {"steamid": "76561198321995165", "personaname": "xXRedJaverXx", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/danrh14/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2254, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2228, "last_played": 1759819291, "avatar": "979935af6766708531cd9e6a836e135e8a003ddd"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Juego excelente para jugar con amigos, gráfico buenos, no consume mucho, buena construcción del juego", "timestamp_created": 1745948426, "timestamp_updated": 1745948426, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193294223", "author": {"steamid": "76561199096231526", "personaname": "KoalaG43", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KoalaGamer43/", "num_games_owned": 38, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 512, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 279, "last_played": 1768353028, "avatar": "2ee25ca024606d7d9dea7bc4bfc8e3194e8a0adf"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Quiero platinarlo, pero siento que me voy a rendir rápido", "timestamp_created": 1745268248, "timestamp_updated": 1745268248, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193121580", "author": {"steamid": "76561199088640814", "personaname": "TitanLocoXD", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TitanLocoXD/", "num_games_owned": 183, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 569, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 516, "last_played": 1780713857, "avatar": "da5680703e95710ef01f8b0711b061d96377196e"}, "language": "latam", "review": "meh", "timestamp_created": 1745086153, "timestamp_updated": 1745086153, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193061604", "author": {"steamid": "76561198109855899", "personaname": "Kapax 🌟", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kapax89/", "num_games_owned": 2310, "num_reviews": 300, "playtime_forever": 1146, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1146, "last_played": 1744941023, "avatar": "30367267f5d0a3a61aaa5329ad7fb018db0350c4"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Bueno, es un juego que fueron mejorando con el tiempo pero ya esta abandonado. Estos tipos de juegos no son para jugar solo, sino con amigos.\nLa historia es un meh, aca solo es acabar hordas de zombies. Puedes comprar o conseguir armas en el juego y mejorar sus acesorios que varian de comun a legendario, como si fuera un battle royale. Supongo que el sistema de cartas es la parte rogue like, cada vez que empiezas un nuevo mapa te sale un conjunto de cartas aleatorias que pueden mejorar o empeorar tu experiencia. \nLos enemigos no son muy dificiles, aunque en dificultades superiores a normal se nota mucho. La verdad que si solo quieres matar zombies con la dificultad reclueta basta y sobra, esta todo en normal y solo no le haces daño a tus amigos.\nLo recomiendo en oferta y SOLO si tienes con alguien para jugarlo, por lo menos 2 amigos mas, el 4to puede ser un bot sin problema, aunque no hace mucho tampoco estorba.\n\nNota: 7/10, de los creadores de [strike]left 4 dead[/strike]... Evolve.", "timestamp_created": 1745021516, "timestamp_updated": 1745021591, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.626890659332275391", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192863755", "author": {"steamid": "76561199467165705", "personaname": "Misugie19", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199467165705/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2257, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 998, "last_played": 1774194167, "avatar": "f20238c33bdcd627be48a8890078b3f4e54285ee"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Realmente back 4 blood no es malo, es muy bueno el problema es que la gentes pone de excusa el sistema de cartas cuando eso personalmente es un punto fuerte al juego, ¿es complejo? El sistema en si es un poco complicado pero eso se arregla buscando tutoriales en Youtube pero les da pereza hacer eso, pero el juego PERSONALMENTE es puro cine en cuento a graficos jefes y demas me encanta ❤️", "timestamp_created": 1744807337, "timestamp_updated": 1744807337, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192414635", "author": {"steamid": "76561199087703092", "personaname": "boo2508", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199087703092/", "num_games_owned": 156, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 2868, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2667, "last_played": 1745436294, "avatar": "c1061e2608d1c7298ba4d891aa76ada7da8b587c"}, "language": "latam", "review": "ㅤ", "timestamp_created": 1744271731, "timestamp_updated": 1744271731, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192367188", "author": {"steamid": "76561198234399852", "personaname": "the gamer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198234399852/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 836, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 309, "last_played": 1745086781, "avatar": "fa614036a6ec0d9ffe362b3f90053f7b25ce0bca"}, "language": "latam", "review": "divertido", "timestamp_created": 1744211023, "timestamp_updated": 1744211023, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "191839234", "author": {"steamid": "76561198872224394", "personaname": "Rarstro", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198872224394/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1096, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1096, "last_played": 1703907454, "avatar": "116b1f3ca5d7f24e5e9da59cc875f6a0e51c1560"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Es un muy buen juego para jugar con compas, lo malo que no te deja ver las salas disponibles en linea solo te mete a una random y ya. La jugabilidad es muy buena, realmente lo recomiendo, un error muy grande es pensar que es una secuela de Lefr 4 dead, éste tiene que verde como un juego aparte, no tiene nada que ver aunque tenga esencia de Left 4 dead no es un Left 4 desd y está bien, es un buen juego, me gustó hacer desmadre con mi carnalillo.", "timestamp_created": 1743637487, "timestamp_updated": 1743637493, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "191752652", "author": {"steamid": "76561198402705623", "personaname": "Pierre", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198402705623/", "num_games_owned": 87, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 1689, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 548, "last_played": 1770675926, "avatar": "4662a47275c022a76ec07507ff777c31f531e64e"}, "language": "latam", "review": "buen juego", "timestamp_created": 1743539120, "timestamp_updated": 1743539120, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}